# Covers dev_smoke_test.sqlite3 AND any suffixed backup of it - the bare
# `*.sqlite3` glob did NOT match `dev_smoke_test.sqlite3.bak_pre_vendorgate`,
# which was therefore tracked in git carrying 4 real pt_users rows (bcrypt
# hashes + emails) and a trusted-device row. Untracked 2026-09-15.
*.sqlite3
*.sqlite3.*
